<section class="container">
  <h2 class="tagline-heading">We believe great things start next door.</h2>
  <img class="wide-image" src="/assets/img/studio.jpg" alt="The Women of Wayland podcast studio: a desk with microphones, headphones and a Women of Wayland sign" width="1511" height="956">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Women of Wayland is a podcast born out of the core belief that the most unassuming women around us have the most remarkable stories to tell.</p>
    <p>We are a seasonal podcast and are currently gearing up for next season. We bring you stories—of hope, triumph and of powerful, inspiring women—from next door.</p>
    <p>Every episode, we will get into soulful conversations that explore a unique side of the guest. Our format is mostly interview-based, though we also have anonymous and travel stories that are narrated. In addition, each season, we also exclusively feature a “Man of Wayland” story, focusing on a man in our town whose work is impacting women’s lives.</p>
    <p>Through time, our vision is to scale this storytelling across other towns in Massachusetts and expand our team. Your support is very much appreciated!</p>
  </div>
</section>

